\tx1103\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls4\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid6829441 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1286 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs23\f1286\cf1\lang1066\langfe1066\langfenp1066\insrsid10706522\charrsid7996928 H\u7895\'3f tr\u7907\'3f kinh ph\'ed t\u7893\'3f
 ch\u7913\'3fc tr\'fdng b\'e0y, tri\u7875\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs23\cf1\lang1066\langfe1066\langfenp1066\insrsid10706522\charrsid7996928 \'e3m ph\'e2n bi\u7879\'3ft s\u7843\'3fn ph\u7849\'3fm }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1286 \ltrch\fcs0 
\cs23\f1286\cf1\lang1066\langfe1066\langfenp1066\insrsid10706522\charrsid7996928 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc b\u7843\'3fo h\u7897\'3f quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu tr\'ed tu\u7879\'3f v\'e0 s\u7843\'3fn ph\u7849\'3fm x\'e2m h\u7841\'3fi quy\u7873\'3fn s
\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu tr\'ed tu\u7879\'3f: Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc h\u7895\'3f tr\u7907\'3f c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn chi ph\'ed thu\'ea m\u7863\'3ft b\u7857\'3fng (\'d0i\u7879\'3fn n\'fd\u7899\'3fc, v\u7879\'3f sinh, an ninh, b\u7843\'3fo v
\u7879\'3f); chi ph\'ed v\u7853\'3fn chuy\u7875\'3fn v\'e0 thi\u7871\'3ft k\u7871\'3f, d\'e0n d\u7921\'3fng gian h\'e0ng; chi ph\'ed ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng chung c\u7911\'3fa Ban t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc (Trang tr\'ed t\u7893\'3fng th\u7875\'3f
, l\u7877\'3f khai m\u7841\'3fc, b\u7871\'3f m\u7841\'3fc, in \u7845\'3fn t\'e0i li\u7879\'3fu v\'e0 c\'e1c chi ph\'ed kh\'e1c li\'ean quan). M\u7913\'3fc h\u7895\'3f tr\u7907\'3f kh\'f4ng qu\'e1 10 tri\u7879\'3fu \'f0\u7891\'3fng/1 \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f
 tham gia.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid10706522\charrsid7996928 
