\cs23\f1286\cf1\lang1066\langfe1066\langfenp1066\insrsid10706522\charrsid7996928 H\u7895\'3f tr\u7907\'3f kinh ph\'ed cho nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f gi\u7899\'3fi thi\u7879\'3fu, qu\u7843\'3fng b\'e1 v\'e0 tri\u7875\'3fn khai c\'e1c ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0
\u7897\'3fng x\'fac ti\u7871\'3fn th\'fd\'f5ng m\u7841\'3fi kh\'e1c cho c\'e1c t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn tr\'ed tu\u7879\'3f c\u7911\'3fa Vi\u7879\'3ft Nam \u7903\'3f trong v\'e0 ngo\'e0i n\'fd\u7899\'3fc; khai th\'e1c, n\'e2ng cao gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f v\'e0 kh
\u7843\'3f n\'e3ng c\u7841\'3fnh tranh c\u7911\'3fa s\u7843\'3fn ph\u7849\'3fm, d\u7883\'3fch v\u7909\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc b\u7843\'3fo h\u7897\'3f quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu tr\'ed tu\u7879\'3f; th\'fd\'f5ng m\u7841\'3fi h\'f3a t\'e0i s
\u7843\'3fn tr\'ed tu\u7879\'3f: Nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f h\u7895\'3f tr\u7907\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng d\'fd\u7899\'3fi h}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs23\cf1\lang1066\langfe1066\langfenp1066\insrsid10706522\charrsid7996928 \'ec
nh th\u7913\'3fc c\'e1c nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f khoa h\u7885\'3fc v\'e0 c\'f4ng ngh\u7879\'3f theo quy }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1286 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs23\f1286\cf1\lang1066\langfe1066\langfenp1066\insrsid10706522\charrsid7996928 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi Th
\'f4ng t\'fd s\u7889\'3f 17/2017/TT-BKHCN. D\u7921\'3f to\'e1n kinh ph\'ed th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi Th\'f4ng t\'fd li\'ean t\u7883\'3fch s\u7889\'3f 55/2015/TTLT-BTC-BKHCN, trong \'f0
\'f3:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid10706522\charrsid7996928 
